{
  "Package": "beachmat.hdf5",
  "Version": "1.8.0",
  "Date": "2025-10-09",
  "Title": "beachmat bindings for HDF5-backed matrices",
  "Description": "Extends beachmat to support initialization of tatami\nmatrices from HDF5-backed arrays. This allows C++ code in\ndownstream packages to directly call the HDF5 C/C++ library to\naccess array data, without the need for block processing via\nDelayedArray. Some utilities are also provided for direct\ncreation of an in-memory tatami matrix from a HDF5 file.",
